{
 "name": "nixl-chunked-off-p-queue",
 "description": "A prefiller (kv_producer) with chunked prefill off under a 64-token budget: a prompt that does not fit what is left of the step waits for the next step; finished requests keep their blocks until the decoder has read them.",
